@startuml
title RAMT - Complete System Architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "End User" as User

package "Client Layer" {
  [Next.js Frontend] as UI
}

package "Application Layer" {
  [FastAPI RAMT API] as API
  [Input Normalizer\nText Cleaning + Unicode NFC] as Norm
  [Retrieval Filter\nThreshold + Top-k Ranking] as Filter
  [Context Builder\nEntity Protection + Context Formatting] as Context
  [Output Postprocessor\nDetokenization + Script Restoration] as Post
}

package "Semantic Retrieval Layer" {
  [LaBSE Encoder\n768-dimensional Embeddings] as LaBSE
  [FAISS ANN Search\nHNSW / Similarity Search] as FAISS
  database "Translation Memory DB\nSQLite OR PostgreSQL" as TMDB
}

package "Translation Layer" {
  [IndicNLP\nNormalization + Script Mapping] as IndicNLP
  [SentencePiece Tokenizer] as Tokenizer
  [IndicTrans2\nTransformer Encoder-Decoder] as MT
  [LoRA Adapter\nOptional if trained] as LoRA
}

package "Offline Indexing" {
  [Parallel Corpus Loader] as Loader
  [Corpus Cleaning + Deduplication] as Clean
  [Metadata Assignment] as Metadata
}

User --> UI
UI --> API : Submit source sentence
API --> Norm : Normalize input
Norm --> LaBSE : Clean source sentence
LaBSE --> FAISS : Query embedding
FAISS --> API : Candidate IDs + scores
API --> TMDB : Fetch candidate sentence pairs
TMDB --> API : Source/target pairs + metadata
API --> Filter : Candidates + similarity scores

Filter --> Context : Accepted top-k examples
Filter --> Context : Empty context on fallback
API --> Context : Original input sentence

Context --> IndicNLP : Prepared input + context
IndicNLP --> Tokenizer : Normalized/script-mapped text
Tokenizer --> MT : Token IDs + target language tag
LoRA ..> MT : Optional trained adaptation
MT --> Post : Generated target tokens
Post --> API : Final native-script translation
API --> UI : Translation + retrieved examples
UI --> User : Display result

Loader --> Clean
Clean --> Metadata
Metadata --> TMDB : Store bilingual pairs + metadata
Metadata --> LaBSE : Source-side sentences
LaBSE --> FAISS : Normalized embeddings
Loader --> FAISS : Build/update persistent index

note right of Filter
Initial similarity threshold: 0.75
Tune on validation data.
If no match is accepted,
use the baseline translation path.
end note

note bottom of TMDB
Store vector-ID mapping so
FAISS results can be resolved
to the original bilingual pair.
end note

@enduml